#* {{quote-text|en|year=2013|author=Julian Sher|title=Somebody's Daughter
|passage=No flashy dressers, skimpily dressed starlets, or celebrities stepping out of stretch '''limos'''. Instead, on a warm Friday evening in June 2009, one hundred protestors sang prayers, chanted slogans, and carried signs {{...}}}}
